IT: la catena di web_search diventa SearXNG → Tavily → Exa → Serper → DuckDuckGo;
ogni livello a pagamento si attiva solo se la sua chiave è impostata e viene
chiamato solo se tutti i livelli precedenti sono andati in errore, in timeout o
senza risultati. Nuova base comune ApiSearchTier (api-search-tier.ts): POST JSON,
timeout, mappatura http(s)/deduplica/limite, log «web_search <Nome> call» per ogni
chiamata (esito, risultati, durata, costo se l'API lo riporta) e passaggio al
livello successivo; un annullamento dell'utente non fa ripiego.
- ExaWebProvider (exa-web.ts): POST https://api.exa.ai/search con x-api-key,
  type auto (EXA_SEARCH_TYPE, es. lite più economico), numResults = limite,
  highlights brevi (300 caratteri) come snippet, inclusi nel prezzo base fino a
  10 risultati; costDollars.total finisce nel log. Timeout EXA_TIMEOUT_MS.
- SerperWebProvider (serper-web.ts): POST https://google.serper.dev/search con
  X-API-KEY, {q, num, gl, hl} (SERPER_GL / SERPER_HL opzionali), organic[]
  title/link/snippet → {title, url, snippet}. Timeout SERPER_TIMEOUT_MS.
WEB_PROVIDER=tavily|exa|serper fa partire la catena da quel livello. Nome
strumento e web_fetch invariati. Test in exa-serper-web.test.ts (catena completa
inclusa).

EN: the web_search chain becomes SearXNG → Tavily → Exa → Serper → DuckDuckGo;
each paid tier is enabled only when its key is set and is called only when every
earlier tier errored, timed out or found nothing. New shared ApiSearchTier base
(api-search-tier.ts): JSON POST, timeout, http(s)/dedupe/cap mapping, a "web_search
<Name> call" log line per call (outcome, results, duration, cost when the API
reports it) and hand-off to the next tier; a user abort does not fall back.
- ExaWebProvider (exa-web.ts): POST https://api.exa.ai/search with x-api-key,
  type auto (EXA_SEARCH_TYPE, e.g. the cheaper lite), numResults = cap, short
  highlights (300 chars) as snippets, included in the base price up to 10
  results; costDollars.total goes to the log. Timeout EXA_TIMEOUT_MS.
- SerperWebProvider (serper-web.ts): POST https://google.serper.dev/search with
  X-API-KEY, {q, num, gl, hl} (optional SERPER_GL / SERPER_HL), organic[]
  title/link/snippet → {title, url, snippet}. Timeout SERPER_TIMEOUT_MS.
WEB_PROVIDER=tavily|exa|serper starts the chain at that tier. Tool name and
web_fetch unchanged. Tests in exa-serper-web.test.ts (including the whole chain).
